        "type": "p",
        "text": "So I'm going to spend a lot of time tuning the throttle and mapping it differently, then driving through a bunch of different scenarios with him. I'm not really going to tell him what I changed. I'll just ask him how it feels and have him describe it to me in words, and then make changes from there."
